  "content": {
    "en": {
      "description": "Social Intelligence (Tromsø Social Intelligence Scale, TSIS). Total = sum of the 21 items (each 1-7), range 21-147; higher = greater social intelligence (reverse-keyed items reversed by the runtime). No standard cut-offs.",
